   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Three essential verbs",
     "texto": [
      "**Pouvoir** (can), **vouloir** (want) and **savoir** (know) are irregular. When one of them is followed by another verb, that verb goes in the **infinitive**: **Je peux venir** (I can come), **Je veux manger** (I want to eat), **Je sais nager** (I know how to swim).",
      "The negation surrounds the conjugated verb: **Je ne sais pas nager**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
