    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Savoir or pouvoir",
     "texto": [
      "For learned knowledge and skills, use **savoir**: **Je sais conduire** (I know how to drive).",
      "**Pouvoir** expresses ability, possibility or permission: **Je peux ouvrir la fenêtre ?** (can I open the window?).",
      "To ask a favour: **Tu peux m'aider ?** (can you help me?)."
     ],
